<p> LONG-TERM DEBT				 265,355		--</p>
<p> TOTAL STOCKHOLDERS' EQUITY (Note 1)  6,624,265     7,002,228</p>
<p>						  8,458,614     8,365,519</p>
<p>Note 1 - Stockholders' equity declined in fiscal 1996 as a result of xchanging the shares of Echelon Service Company for shares of the Company's $.01 par value common stock.</p>
